Description: Implements clone-censor-weight target trial emulation for
    observational studies in the OMOP Common Data Model. The package
    follows the OHDSI HADES framework and provides data extraction,
    cloning, inverse probability weighting for artificial censoring
    (deviation from the treatment strategies), weighted outcome models
    with person-clustered robust and bootstrap variances, covariate
    balance diagnostics, and a simulator with known true risks.
